# Deploy to live site

When the user asks for app fixes or UI changes for SwapHub:

1. Implement the fix in the repo.
2. Commit the relevant changes (unless they only asked for a local experiment).
3. Push to `origin` on the current branch so Vercel can redeploy https://swaphub-web.vercel.app.
4. Tell the user the live URL after push.

Do not wait for a separate "please push" request for routine product fixes.
